s", "target_term": "态射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>，只需考察对象（object）<MATH_0001>（属于<MATH_0002>）上的纤维（fibre）范畴（categories）。右端的对象（object）是三元组（triple）<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>中的态射（morphism）。函子（functor）<MATH_0006>将对象（object）<MATH_0007>（属于<MATH_0008>）映（maps）到三元组（triple）<MATH_0009>。注意，<MATH_0010>在本质（essential）像（image）中（对于<MATH_0011>），当且仅当<MATH_0012>对某个态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>（在<MATH_0014>中）成立（细节省略）。因此，要使<MATH_0015>是等价（equivalence），每个<MATH_0016>都必须是某个态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>的像（image），而且任意两个不同的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0018>都必须给出不同的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0019>。这就证明了引理。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:52f7a6c5cd4083572d90746eb147721956c87cdd226951f01503d80c46ff7061", "unit_id": "tag:04Z7:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所考察的纤维范畴；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "基底对象上的纤维；待决。", "source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"context": "基底、纤维积及原范畴中的对象；待决。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "纤维积对象的数据；待决。", "source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "三元组分量及需提升的态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "所考察的对角函子；待决。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "对角函子对对象的作用；待决。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映"}, {"context": "函子本质像的限定；待决。", "source_term": "essential", "target_term": "本质"}, {"context": "本质像或态射的像；待决。", "source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"context": "对角函子的等价性质；待决。", "source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "由忠实性需区分的两个态射及其像；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}]}
